            },
            "reviewBody": "This was an utter fail. I wasted all the ingredients by making this. My husband, daughter and I couldn’t even eat it. The cloves were beyond overpowering- like you’re eating a Christmas pine cone without the crunch. The result was a syrupy overly sweet mess. I feel like I’ve been punked. I’m sorry to be a downer but I need to let the public know!!!",
